{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young girl is transported to a magical world filled with wondrous creatures and powerful magic. She will learn spells, gather resources, befriend companions, run her own shop, and transform this world through building and adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><i><strong>Magical Exploration</strong> \u2014 Learn a variety of magical abilities. Use climbing, swimming, jumping, and flying to explore every corner of the world and uncover its hidden secrets.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943760/extras/33b37559822f6c0041d15fccc6ebd7fb.poster.avif?t=1755536776\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943760/extras/33b37559822f6c0041d15fccc6ebd7fb.webm?t=1755536776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943760/extras/33b37559822f6c0041d15fccc6ebd7fb.mp4?t=1755536776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i></i><br><br><strong>Town Building</strong> \u2014 Use your construction skills and magical powers to freely design buildings and facilities, creating a unique and lively settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943760/extras/792f1b3ec871bb61896708ef31085b32.poster.avif?t=1755536776\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943760/extras/792f1b3ec871bb61896708ef31085b32.webm?t=1755536776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943760/extras/792f1b3ec871bb61896708ef31085b32.mp4?t=1755536776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Automated Management</strong> \u2014 Meet and recruit NPCs with distinct personalities to help run your shop and gather materials, keeping your town thriving.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943760/extras/8baa8695df606071d77ba5491d227574.avif?t=1755536776\" width=853 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperative Multiplayer</strong> \u2014 Team up with up to 4 players to face the challenges of this magical world together, building your dream realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist  the game to stay updated on the latest news!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943760/extras/0838e3feb9aeb16892f23650a115bbf3.avif?t=1755536776\" width=1337 height=476 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3943760?t=1755536776","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3943760?t=1755536776","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943760/24e2f6719675b892293c6371107f26209e3f4575/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755536776","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943760/24e2f6719675b892293c6371107f26209e3f4575/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755536776","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"descr